        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 192, Beacon Hill 11-1/4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 11-1/4 Inch Beacon Hill Cabinet Pull has a classic design that is well-suited to historic America. These traditional cabinet pulls feature an Early American look that make them perfect as not only rejuvenation hardware but also for people who love old world glamour. The Beacon Hill 11-1/4 Inch Pull is available in satin nickel and polished nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Beacon+Hill\">MNG Beacon Hill Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 192 Beacon Hill 11-1/4 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length:12-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
